/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Card Calypso Crypto Legacy SAM C++ Library
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Card Calypso Crypto Legacy SAM C++ Library** is a Keyple add-on
 * that provides support for Calypso cryptographic operations using legacy SAM
 * (Secure Application Module) cards.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Legacy SAM card support
 * - Calypso cryptographic operations
 * - Secure session key management
 * - Authentication and signature operations
 * - Integration with Calypso card library
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
 * - **API Documentation**: [docs.keyple.org/keyple-card-calypso-crypto-legacysam-cpp-lib](https://docs.keyple.org/keyple-card-calypso-crypto-legacysam-cpp-lib)
 * - **Examples**: [github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example](https://github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example)
 */
